import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.TrianglePeriodFamilyGammaZeroTorusHomology

/-!
# The actual zero-γ fibre and its homology

The literal kernel of the first circle coordinate in the original real
period torus is an actual three-torus and a continuous retract.  Its native
singular homology inclusion is therefore injective in every degree, and
its homology vanishes above degree three.
-/
